  message: "Canonical row for the Python-variable shape_id=null defect (WI-zidal folded in as TRUE_DUPLICATE, 2026-07-15). Ported parity evidence: go/swift variable-kind nodes DO get shape_id (2/2, 1/1) — it's a py.py analyzer-parity gap (_compute_shape_id typed FunctionDef|ClassDef-only, py.py:1678; _emit_module_level_assign_symbols builds kind='variable' with no shape_id call). Now a WI-vogij prerequisite: the clone/refactoring-lead feature needs shape_id populated on variable nodes."  # e0f4
