  clock: 8  # 85ce
  nonce: 85ce  # 85ce
  message: "Closed by G1 bundle merged as dev d007532a38 (PR #808). Python variable- and field-kind Symbols carried shape_id=None because _compute_shape_id required a body-bearing FunctionDef/ClassDef node. New _compute_value_shape_id(node,kind) hashes the assignment statement's AST skeleton via _ast_structure (kind folded per WI-linon), wired at the variable (py.py) and field (py.py, WI-jusus emission) sites. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE: 4 new tests in test_py_shape_id_kind.py assert variables/fields carry sha256: shape_ids, distinct shapes differ, same shapes share, and kind discriminates (variable vs field). Additive (no existing shape_id value changes) -> shape_id_scheme UNCHANGED (WI-rihob null->value precedent: its commit 5b8a44805f did not touch the scheme). Scope-note: the field-kind analogue was folded in (item statement named only variable). Downstream clone detection (WI-vogij) still needs its _CLONE_KINDS widened to surface variable/field clones; WI-luzut only populates the field."  # 85ce
